<template>
    <heading>Global page layout</heading>
    <keywords>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>layout</li>
        <li>navigation</li>
        <li>panes</li>
        <li>status bar</li>
    </keywords>
    <section data-lp5-kind="explanation">
        <p>
            The page is a column: the navigation bar is at the top, the
            three working panes fill the middle, and the status bar is at
            the bottom. The middle row may shrink below the viewport's
            height because each pane owns its own scrolling.
        </p>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 560 214"
             role="img" aria-labelledby="pageLayoutTitle pageLayoutDescription"
             style="display:block; width:min(100%, 560px); height:auto; margin:0.75rem auto; font:12px sans-serif">
            <title id="pageLayoutTitle">LP5 page layout</title>
            <desc id="pageLayoutDescription">A top navigation bar, three middle panes separated by draggable splitters, and a bottom status bar.</desc>
            <rect x="8" y="8" width="544" height="198" rx="5" fill="#fff" stroke="#526174" stroke-width="2"/>
            <g>
                <title>#LP5-TopNav: the navigation bar at the top of the page. It takes only the space its contents need.</title>
                <rect x="18" y="18" width="524" height="28" rx="3" fill="#dce8f5" stroke="#7890aa"/>
                <text x="280" y="36" text-anchor="middle" fill="#17283a">#LP5-TopNav</text>
            </g>

            <g>
                <title>#LP5-Main: the flexible middle row. It contains the Table of Contents, Source, and Output panes, with splitters between them.</title>
                <rect x="14" y="52" width="532" height="114" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="#526174" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 2"/>
                <text x="24" y="68" fill="#526174">#LP5-Main</text>
                <g>
                    <title>#LP5-Toc: the Table of Contents pane. It starts at one quarter of the middle row's width and scrolls independently.</title>
                    <rect x="18" y="72" width="116" height="84" rx="3" fill="#edf2f7" stroke="#7890aa"/>
                    <text x="76" y="119" text-anchor="middle" fill="#17283a">#LP5-Toc</text>
                </g>

                <g>
                    <title>.LP5-PaneSplitter: a narrow draggable divider that changes the widths of the panes on either side.</title>
                    <rect x="138" y="72" width="8" height="84" fill="#8293a6"/>
                    <path d="M142 100v16 M139 104l3-4 3 4 M139 112l3 4 3-4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                </g>

                <g>
                    <title>#LP5-Source: the pane that displays the selected articles' explanations and code definitions. It scrolls independently.</title>
                    <rect x="150" y="72" width="184" height="84" rx="3" fill="#f7f4e8" stroke="#b5a36e"/>
                    <text x="242" y="119" text-anchor="middle" fill="#342d1c">#LP5-Source</text>
                </g>

                <g>
                    <title>.LP5-PaneSplitter: a narrow draggable divider that changes the widths of the panes on either side.</title>
                    <rect x="338" y="72" width="8" height="84" fill="#8293a6"/>
                    <path d="M342 100v16 M339 104l3-4 3 4 M339 112l3 4 3-4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                </g>

                <g>
                    <title>#LP5-Output: the pane that shows generated code. It shares the remaining middle-row width and scrolls independently.</title>
                    <rect x="350" y="72" width="192" height="84" rx="3" fill="#e8f2eb" stroke="#7d9c84"/>
                    <text x="446" y="119" text-anchor="middle" fill="#203b29">#LP5-Output</text>
                </g>
            </g>

            <g>
                <title>#LP5-Status: a short status bar along the bottom edge of the page. It does not grow with the middle row.</title>
                <rect x="18" y="176" width="524" height="20" rx="2" fill="#dce8f5" stroke="#7890aa"/>
                <text x="280" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#17283a">#LP5-Status</text>
            </g>
        </svg>
    </section>
    <section data-lp5-kind="code">
        <name>Global CSS declarations</name>
        <code><![CDATA[
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html,
body {
    height: 100%;
    margin: 0;
}

body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
}

#LP5-TopNav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    background: #dce8f5;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #7890aa;
}

.LP5-MenuEntry {
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid #7890aa;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #fff;
}

#LP5-Main {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 0;
    min-width: 0;
}

#LP5-Toc,
#LP5-Source,
#LP5-Output {
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 0;
    overflow: auto;
}

#LP5-Toc {
    flex: 0 0 25%;
}

#LP5-Source,
#LP5-Output {
    flex: 1 1 0;
}

.LP5-PaneSplitter {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 4px;
    cursor: col-resize;
}

.LP5-PaneSplitter::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 1px;
    width: 2px;
    background: #8293a6;
}

.LP5-PaneSplitter:hover::after {
    left: 0;
    width: 4px;
    background: #526174;
}

#LP5-Status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex: 0 0 1.5rem;
    min-height: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0 0.5rem;
    background: #dce8f5;
    border-top: 1px solid #7890aa;
}
]]></code>
    </section>
</template>
